window.products.push({"id":602166,"name":"OWENIE 4 PCS Thanksgiving Placemats for Dining Table, 13 x 19 Inch Set of 4 Embroidered Maple Leaves Table mats for Fall, Harvest Applique Leaf for Au","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d3B85VcML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester [FEATURE]--These table placemats combinated fall colors with unique Sateen maple leaves with embroidery and hand cutwork, makes this place mat elegant and high-quality. Intricate cutouts along the edges are the perfect finishing touch. Classic colors in green, yellow, brown, rust and burgundy are not easy to fade, easy to match your autumn table decoration, add a thanksgiving atmosphere to your home. [GOOD QUALITY]--These table place mats are made of 100% polyester fabric. Made by our Oeko-Tex certified factory. Most of the maple leaves are appliqué, with allover embroidery and cutwork, subtle and not too flashy. Good quality giving a long lasting use. Could be used for all the autumn season. [MULTI-FUNCTION]--These table mats could be used all through the fall season. They are very suitable for breakfast nooks, kitchen counters and dining tables, farmhouse table or entryway tables to instantly decorate your room. Also suitable for the living room, bedroom, farmhouse, rustic, barn, woodland, vint table. Good for everyday use, parties, Easter, Fall Harvest, Thanksgiving day, Halloween, Christmas, holidays etc. [SIZE]--Package includes 1 set of 4 pieces placemats in same color. Each size measures 13in x 19in Rectangle. Various sizes and shapes of matching placemats and runners are aviailable, for your easy collocation and docoration. Matching Table runners and placemats are sold separately, it is recommended to buy together for more beautiful effect. [EASY TO CLEAN]--Suitable for hand or machine washing. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low. cool iron as needed. Good quality could be used multiple times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d3B85VcML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OWENIE","source_asin":"B093WBQ5FS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-602166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093WBQ5FS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093WBQ5FS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
