window.products.push({"id":602204,"name":"Clothes Storage Bag Organizer with Moth Protection – Cedar Insert to Protect from Moth, Insects, Moist etc.- Extra Large – Perfect for Storing Pillows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ddfvXiHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This seasonal garment storage bag and wardrobe organizer is perfect for protecting your seasonal clothes, sweaters and sheet sets from dust, mildew, mold and moths. This storage bag is made of thick breathable material with aromatic cedar inserts, to protect from moth. Unlike any other storage bags that easily deteriorate and has poor protective capacity, these cedar storage bags keep your belongings free of musty odor and discoloration from mildew. Storage bags are made to give your under-bed space and closet space a whole new function. This XL storage bag is ideal for bedding, comforters, pillows, blankets and all bulky items. It helps you stay organized and keeps them from catching dirt and mildew. Don't need your comforter, linens, or coats for the season? Hide them away with these highly-functional storage bags.While other products promise to offer an extra layer of protection when storing them away for the season, most products fail to protect your bedsheets, comforters, pillows, and coats from mold moths and mildew. We see to it that our extra layer of protection secures your clothes in their top-most quality. This cedar storage protects its content from varying conditions, including humidity and warmer temperatures. This collapsible wardrobe organizer is perfect for your under bed storage. Measuring 24\" x 15\" x 18\" this cedar storage bags fit your shirts, accessories, linens, blankets and all seasonal items. You can fit this nifty storage organizer on your closet shelves, under beds or in drawers and trunks. Manufactured to be wear and tear-resistant, this storage bag is made of polyester, keeping the thread intact and free of runs. Ditch those cotton or wool storage bags you've been using. This cedar storage organizer gives you maximum protection from the most durable materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ddfvXiHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOLDN’ STORAGE","source_asin":"B084MMR7SP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-602204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084MMR7SP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084MMR7SP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
