window.products.push({"id":602410,"name":"Ceramic Knife - 6 Inch Ceramic Chef Knife - Mirror Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V+aO5bTeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will love the convenience of this 6 inches ceramic utility knife. Its ergonomically designed handle is very comfortable and the ceramic blade is super lightweight. Making the Big Bang Cooking Ceramic Knife extra easy and smooth to use.   The blade of this knife is made of zirconium dioxide, also known as zirconia. This material is extremely hard and will keep its sharpness 12 times longer than usual steel knives . In other words, you will not need to sharpen your knife all the time. It will always be ready for you to cut your food when you will want to use it.   Let's put it simply, it is not chemically possible for ceramic to rust. So you will never find this knife to get rusty.   Ceramic is much more chemically stable than steel, so it will leave less bacteria on your food than a steel knife.   Zirconia is one of the hardest material that exist. Therefore, it cannot be sharpened by whatsoever. This ceramic knife can be sharpened only by diamond sharpeners. Because diamond is one of a few materials harder than zirconia.   Can be used for chopping, slicing and mincing food. Avoid cutting frozen meat, meat with bones and cheese.   Our main concern with this product is customer satisfaction. We know you love a great product for a low price, this is why we chose to invest more in the product development and less in fancy boxes. We chose a box that is safe, reliable and inexpensive. This is how we can offer such quality product for an unbeatable price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V+aO5bTeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Bang Cooking","source_asin":"B00RHZIXNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-602410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RHZIXNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RHZIXNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
