window.products.push({"id":602534,"name":"XINGHANG Airtight Smell Proof Stash Jar Aluminum Storage Container 97ml, Waterproof Durable Multi-Use Portable Jar.Screw-Top Lid Lock Odor – Black (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c5XP2jpyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are a company with a soul. We want our jars to bring you pleasure, joy and provide comfort. We realize the importance of combining quality, safety, stylish design, multi-functionality and care for the environment into our products. That is why we have a responsible attitude for every process so that all these qualities are combined in our jars so you get your new most favorite stash jar.  Our jar is a multifunctional container for storing products. They have several advantages over other jars:  ✅Airtight / Odor Proof – You don't need to worry that the smells from the contents of a jar will come out, since the jar has a special rubber seal on the lid which creates maximum tightness and helps keep your products fresh for a long time ✅100% Recyclable – Our jars are made of recyclable materials, which helps us keep our planet greener. Let's take care of the planet together ✅Rustproof – Aluminum jars don't rust as they are resistant to color loss or corrosion, unlike glass jars with metal lids that are prone to rapid corrosion ✅Portable / Lightweight – Our jars are lightweight, thanks to their compact size, so you can easily take it with you on a trip or for a walk. It fits easily and comfortably into your pocket, handbag or backpack and you won't even know it’s there ✅Multi-use – You can store anything you like: herbs, spices, weeds, teas, coffee, pills, tobacco and other products that have a strong odor. You can also store them at home, or take them with you to work, study or on the road. Because of their compact size, they will become your companion anywhere you go.  We will do everything we can so you have only a positive experience buying from us. Click the \"Add to cart\" button to order your new stash jar now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c5XP2jpyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINGHANG","source_asin":"B08T9SGC1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-602534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T9SGC1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T9SGC1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
