window.products.push({"id":602936,"name":"4 Pack of Sandalwood Scented Gel Candle Mineral Oil Based Tea Lights Hand Poured in USA by The Gel Candle CompanyTM - up to 8 Hours Each …","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hneKaxSlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Four mineral oil based scented tea light candles packaged and prepared by hand in USA since 2005. Each has a burn time of up to 8 hours. Each of our fragrances vary in strength. Color may vary. net wt. 2.25 oz. (64g) Each candle actual size: W: 1 1/2\" x H: 1\". Packs of 24 also available. Please Read Candle Safety And Burn Responsibly: For a proper burn pool Initial burn time should be 2-3 hours. Do not allow debris/matches to fall into melt pool, do not burn near a draft. Keep wick centered at all times & trimmed to 1/4\". If longer than 1/4\", extinguish & trim. Gel burns hotter than paraffin wax. Do not burn longer than 4 hours at a time, any thin glass holders my crack if misused. Never leave burning candle unattended. Keep candle level in room temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hneKaxSlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Gel Candle Company","source_asin":"B00A9XCMZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-602936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A9XCMZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A9XCMZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
